'''Cherry Isles''' (桜んぼ島 ''Sakuranbojima'', '''Cherry Island''') is the 11th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 60th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Cherry Isles is a remake of [[Volkanos Volcano]]. This one is going to be tough, as the only relief stage is [[Ashen Rain]], which is just about knocking back the [[Metal Hippoe]]s. Otherwise, each stage requires a different approach and lineup. Good luck with this one!
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

