==Trivia==
*Cherry Isles' Japanese name, Sakuranbojima (桜んぼ島, "Cherry Island"), is most likely a reference to [[wikipedia:Sakurajima|Sakurajima]] (桜島, "Cherry Blossom Island"), an active stratovolcano and the most active volcano in Japan.

